include init.mod
variable up equal 1e-06
variable atomjiggle equal 1.0e-5
units metal
variable cfac equal 1.0e-4
variable cunits string GPa
variable etol equal 1.0e-8
variable ftol equal 1.0e-12
variable maxiter equal 0.0
variable maxeval equal 50000
variable dmax equal 1.0e-2
boundary p p p
read_data C0_mpack_8_minimized.data
Reading data file ...
  triclinic box = (0.0091266958 0.0081211711 -0.0037579618) to (17.590873 17.591879 17.603758) with tilt (1.0766946e-15 1.0781494e-15 1.0781494e-15)
  1 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
